<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of News Corp Ltd as neutral with a price target of $25-26.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/8 to 22-5/8 in NYSE trading.</p>
<p>-- &quot;While News Corp often appears to be relatively inexpensive (under eight times cash flow) within a peer group of (Walt) Disney (Co), Time Warner (Inc) and Viacom (Inc), we currently find it difficult to calculate a target price that promises enough upside to offset some risks we see in the story,&quot; analyst Larry Petrella said in a brief report.</p>
<p>-- He noted some benefits were offset by the dilution from the New World acquisition and possible difficulties at the Fox Network.</p>
</text>
